<title>USA: Central Jersey shareholders OK merger.</title>
<headline>Central Jersey shareholders OK merger.</headline>
<dateline>EAST BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Jersey Financial Corp said Wednesday that a merger agreement with Summit Bancorp was approved by stockholders at its annual meeting.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. The company did not say when the merger was expected to close.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
